      "created_at": "2021-08-25T19:57:05.489Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My response would be that since it doesn’t say “on yourself” then you can pick whichever one you want. I mean, I guess there <em>could</em> be a reason you’d want to remove a bonus on yourself, but it’s more useful to do so on an antagonist.</p>",
